      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <h3 class="display-2"><strong>The Sound of the Shofar</strong></h3>
        <p class="display-7 mt-3">
          The shofar blast is a call to awaken, to remember, and to prepare our hearts. 
          Throughout Scripture, the shofar announces kings, battles, warnings, and worship.
        </p>
        <ul class="display-7 mt-3">
          <li>Leviticus 23 — Command to observe the day</li>
          <li>Numbers 29 — Offerings of the day</li>
          <li>Nehemiah 8 — Gathering and hearing the Torah</li>
          <li>Psalms 81 — “Blow the shofar at the new moon…”</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

